      }
    },
    {
      "key": "71b6cd4c-8f37-47df-8b80-2006864cf642",
      "position": 8,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-refresh\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Circulate:** Look for students who give very general answers and prompt them to add a specific example (for instance, a skill they'd keep vs. one they'd offload). For students who need support, offer a sentence stem from the organizer."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "71b6cd4c-8f37-47df-8b80-2006864cf642",
        "lesson_activity.key": "d68f3932-1b69-4d73-80c4-078703c1e7c5"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "a93cfca8-5989-4676-a36f-a48ee21fc78f",
      "position": 9,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa-solid fa-bullseye-arrow\"></i> **Goal of this activity:** Students apply their evidence to create clear, actionable guidelines for how they will use AI for the remainder of the course and in their final project.",
        "duration": "20",
        "name": "Project Work"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "a93cfca8-5989-4676-a36f-a48ee21fc78f",
        "lesson_activity.key": "d68f3932-1b69-4d73-80c4-078703c1e7c5"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "4b848b17-94da-40cc-8425-39d8444dfa24",
      "position": 10,
      "properties": {
        "description": "It’s time to build your Privacy Shield. You will now draft the Safety and Privacy section of your guide. You need to provide clear, actionable advice based on the evidence you've gathered. Explain why it matters based on what you saw in your explorations.",
        "remarks": true
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "4b848b17-94da-40cc-8425-39d8444dfa24",
        "lesson_activity.key": "d68f3932-1b69-4d73-80c4-078703c1e7c5"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "a7d1afae-115e-434e-a32a-cb093eef803d",
      "position": 11,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Do This:** Review the Project Checklist under the Project Work section in the Learning Log. Emphasize that they should aim for realistic strategies that allow for AI use while maintaining safety.",
        "tips": [
          {
            "type": "teachingTip",
            "markdown": "Push for nuance—avoid \"never\" or \"always\" statements. Ask students to cite one example from their evidence to justify each guideline."
          },
          {
            "type": "assessmentOpportunity",
            "markdown": "Check that each student's draft includes evidence and that at least one guideline ties to specific evidence from their exploration."
          }
        ]
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "a7d1afae-115e-434e-a32a-cb093eef803d",
        "lesson_activity.key": "d68f3932-1b69-4d73-80c4-078703c1e7c5"
      }
    },
