      "key": "746b3838-a9ef-4bfb-9b0d-ecce46db66c5",
      "position": 12,
      "properties": {
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "746b3838-a9ef-4bfb-9b0d-ecce46db66c5",
        "lesson_activity.key": "d68f3932-1b69-4d73-80c4-078703c1e7c5"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "da129f92-a2e4-496c-9bbe-59ad629a65f5",
      "position": 13,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-desktop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Transition:** Direct students to Lesson 8, Level 1. Students will begin drafting the Safety and Security portion of their project.\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-refresh\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Circulate:** Look for drafts that include (a) a clear evidence from explorations and mini-lessons, (b) rules, guidance, and advice that comes from those sources, and (c) a connections to specific conversations from the jigsaw. Prompt students who miss any of these to add one concrete example or check.",
        "progression_name": "Project Work - Milestone 4"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
